        "original_id": "e35b28b4-fca4-5be0-a5e4-b26de130113d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Leo, Ravi\n- Music Groups: Stiltskin, Genesis, VIXX, VIXX LR\n- Companies: Jellyfish Entertainment\n- Roles: vocalist, singer, songwriter, musical theatre actor, rapper\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968 and is a Scottish musician.\n- Ray Wilson is best known as the vocalist in Stiltskin and in Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- Leo, born Jung Taek-woon on 10 November 1990, is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and musical theatre actor.\n- Leo is signed under Jellyfish Entertainment.\n- VIXX LR was established in August 2015.\n- VIXX LR consists of VIXX's main vocalist Leo and main rapper Ravi.\n- VIXX is a South Korean boy band.\n- VIXX LR is a sub-unit of VIXX formed by Jellyfish Entertainment.",
